// Lenny faces: ( ͡° ͜ʖ ͡°) and variants ( ͠° ͟ʖ ͡°), ( ͡~ ͜ʖ ͡°), ( ͡° ʖ̯ ͡°) ...
// Any of: the degree sign (eyes), the ʖ (U+0296) mouth, or the combining double-inverted-breve family U+035C-U+0362 (eyebrows/nose).
const LENNY_REGEX = /[°ʖ͜-͢]/;
function is_lenny(text) {
    return LENNY_REGEX.test(text);
}
/** Count one lenny for this message (player makes their sfx sometimes, handles the overload events). */
function add_lenny_count(player) {
    LENNY_COUNT++;
    if (player.sfx_ent?.IsValid()) {
        const hmm = getRandomInt(0, 100);
        if (hmm < 9) {
            ent_fire_target({ target: player.sfx_ent, input: "StartSound" });
        }
    }
    ent_fire_name({ name: "text_lenny_counter", input: "SetMessage", value: "LENNY COUNTER: " + LENNY_COUNT.toString() });
    update_lenny_hud();
    if (LENNY_COUNT + 50 == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERFLOW IS NIGH");
    }
    if (LENNY_COUNT + 40 == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        Console.ServerCommand("say PLEASE STOP LENNYING");
    }
    if (LENNY_COUNT + 30 == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        Console.ServerCommand("say SANTA IS BEGGING YOU TO STOP LENNYING");
    }
    if (LENNY_COUNT + 20 == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        Console.ServerCommand("say YOUR MOTHER (I AM BANGING HER RIGHT NOW) IS BEGGING YOU TO STOP LENNYING");
    }
    if (LENNY_COUNT + 10 == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        Console.ServerCommand("say FUCKING GOOBER STOP LENNYING YOU LITTLE BITCH");
    }
    if (LENNY_COUNT == LENNY_OVERLOAD) {
        LENNY_OVERLOAD = LENNY_COUNT + getRandomInt(1000, 5000);
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERLOAD");
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERLOAD");
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERLOAD");
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERLOAD");
        Console.ServerCommand("say WARNING LENNY OVERLOAD");
        ent_fire_name({ name: "sfx_lenny", input: "StartSound" });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "music_lenny", input: "StartSound", delay: 10 });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "overlay_lenny", input: "Start", delay: 10 });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "music_fader", input: "SetFloatValue", value: 0 });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "shake_lenny", input: "StartShake", delay: 10 });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "music_fader", input: "SetFloatValue", value: 1, delay: 210 });
        ent_fire_name({ name: "overlay_lenny", input: "Stop", delay: 210 });
        LENNY = true;
        setTimeout(() => { LENNY = false; }, 210 * 1000);
    }
}
Instance.OnPlayerChat((stuff) => {
    if (stuff.player == undefined) {
        return;
    }
    const player_controller = stuff.player;
    const player = player_controller.GetPlayerPawn();
    if (!player?.IsAlive()) {
        return;
    }
    const text = stuff.text.toLowerCase();
    if (player?.IsValid()) {
        if (text.slice(0, 4).includes("!aim") && player?.IsValid()) {
            if (player.materia_aim) {
                ent_fire_name({ name: "hh_materia_aim", input: "SetMessage", value: "Materia Aiming is Disabled" });
                ent_fire_name({ name: "hh_materia_aim", input: "ShowHudHint", activator: player });
                player.materia_aim = false;
                toggle_materia_aim(player);
            }
            else {
                ent_fire_name({ name: "hh_materia_aim", input: "SetMessage", value: "Materia Aiming is Enabled" });
                ent_fire_name({ name: "hh_materia_aim", input: "ShowHudHint", activator: player });
                player.materia_aim = true;
                toggle_materia_aim(player);
            }
        }
        if (is_lenny(text)) {
            add_lenny_count(player);
        }
        if (text.includes("!xmas") && player.sfx_ent?.IsValid() && (player.sfx_cd ?? 0) < Instance.GetGameTime()) {
            player.sfx_cd = Instance.GetGameTime() + SFX_COOLDOWN;
            ent_fire_target({ target: player.sfx_ent, input: "StartSound" });
        }
        //!text,targetnam||name||slot,text
        if (text.includes("!text") && player.mapper) {
            const inputs = text.split(',');
            const target_str = inputs[1]?.trim() ?? "";
            // everything after the 2nd comma, so messages can contain commas
            const text_non_lower = stuff.text.split(",").slice(2).join(",");
            if (target_str != "") {
                const targets = find_ents_by_class("player");
                for (const target of targets) {
                    if (!target?.IsValid() || !target.text_ent?.IsValid()) {
                        continue;
                    }
                    if (target_str.includes("@all")
                        || (target.name ?? "").includes(target_str)
                        || target.GetEntityName().includes(target_str)
                        || (target.slot ?? "").toString().includes(target_str)) {
                        ent_fire_target({ target: target.text_ent, input: "SetMessage", value: text_non_lower });
                        ent_fire_target({ target: target.text_ent, input: "Color", value: random_text_color() });
                    }
                }
            }
        }
        if (text.includes("!player_info") && player.mapper) {
            const players = find_ents_by_class("player");
            for (const player of players) {
                if (player?.IsValid()) {
                    const controller = player.GetPlayerController();
                    Console.ClientCommand(player_controller.GetPlayerSlot(), "echo " + controller.GetPlayerName() +
                        " --- Slot: " + controller.GetPlayerSlot() + " --- Target Name: " + player.GetEntityName());
                }
            }
        }
        if (text.includes("!lenny_check") && player.mapper) {
            Console.ClientCommand(player.slot, "echo Lenny Overload: " + LENNY_OVERLOAD.toString());
        }
        if (text.includes("!csr") && player.mapper) {
            vending_machine_csr();
            abyssal_step_csr();
            // ent_fire_name({name:"csr_secret",input:"Unlock"});
            // ent_fire_name({name:"csr_secret",input:"Press",delay:0.01});
        }
        if (text.startsWith("!song ") && player.mapper) {
            radio_override(text.slice(6).trim());
        }
        if (text.trim() == "!skip" && player.mapper) {
            radio_skip();
        }
        // mapper: drop an ultima right where you're standing
        if (text.trim() == "!ultima" && player.mapper) {
            spawn_ultima(player.GetAbsOrigin(), { pitch: 0, yaw: player.GetAbsAngles().yaw, roll: 0 });
        }
        // mapper: switch how parried snowballs fly back (zombie aim <-> straight back the way they came)
        if (text.trim() == "!parrymode" && player.mapper) {
            PARRY_RETURN_MODE = PARRY_RETURN_MODE == "eye" ? "reverse" : "eye";
            Console.ServerCommand("say [mapper] parry return mode: " + (PARRY_RETURN_MODE == "eye" ? "zombie aim" : "straight back"));
        }
        // mapper: live-tune the earth box (turn it 90 / flip the X bias), redraws it if an earth is out
        if ((text.trim() == "!earthrot" || text.trim() == "!earthflip") && player.mapper) {
            if (text.trim() == "!earthrot") {
                EARTH_BOX_YAW = (EARTH_BOX_YAW + 90) % 360;
            }
            else {
                EARTH_BOX_X_OFFSET = -EARTH_BOX_X_OFFSET;
            }
            Console.ServerCommand("say [mapper] earth box: EARTH_BOX_YAW = " + EARTH_BOX_YAW + ", EARTH_BOX_X_OFFSET = " + EARTH_BOX_X_OFFSET);
            const earth = any_earth_prop();
            if (earth?.IsValid()) {
                draw_earth_box(earth, 5);
            }
        }
        // mapper: draw the earth collision box while the earth is out (and right now, if one exists)
        if (text.trim() == "!earthdebug" && player.mapper) {
            EARTH_DEBUG_DRAW = !EARTH_DEBUG_DRAW;
            Console.ServerCommand("say [mapper] earth debug draw: " + (EARTH_DEBUG_DRAW ? "on" : "off"));
            const earth = any_earth_prop();
            if (EARTH_DEBUG_DRAW && earth?.IsValid()) {
                draw_earth_box(earth, 10);
            }
            if (EARTH_DEBUG_DRAW) {
                // test marker 128u in front of you for 10s: if you can't see this, debug drawing doesn't work on this server
                const eye = player.GetEyePosition();
                const ahead = Vector3Utils.add(eye, Vector3Utils.scale(getForwardVector(player.GetEyeAngles()), 128));
                Instance.DebugSphere({ center: ahead, radius: 16, duration: 10, color: { r: 255, g: 0, b: 255 } });
                Instance.DebugLine({ start: Vector3Utils.add(ahead, { x: 0, y: 0, z: -64 }), end: Vector3Utils.add(ahead, { x: 0, y: 0, z: 64 }), duration: 10, color: { r: 0, g: 255, b: 0 } });
                Console.Log("earth debug: drew a test sphere in front of " + player.GetEntityName() + (earth?.IsValid() ? " and the current earth box" : " (no earth out right now)"));
            }
        }
        if (text.trim() == "!modelmenu" || text.trim() == "!genderswap") {
            open_model_menu(player_controller);
        }
        // mapper: put every alive human (except you) in a random DOA model for this round; model_pref is not touched
        if (text.startsWith("!genderswapall") && player.mapper) {
            const next_doa = make_shuffle_bag(DOA_MODELS.map(m => m[1]));
            const players = find_ents_by_class("player");
            for (const target of players) {
                if (target?.IsValid() && target.IsAlive() && target.GetTeamNumber() == 3 && !target.mapper) {
                    set_player_model(target, next_doa());
                }
            }
        }
    }
});
const player_head_offset = { x: 0, y: 0, z: 64 };
function player_head(player) {
    return Vector3Utils.add(player.GetAbsOrigin(), player_head_offset);
}
const materia_offset = { x: 0, y: 0, z: 48 };
function materia_spawn_offset(origin) {
    return Vector3Utils.add(origin, materia_offset);
}
const buddy_offset = { x: 0, y: 0, z: 32 };
const buddy_xy_offset = 16;
function player_buddy_position(player) {
    const forward = getForwardVector(player.GetAbsAngles());
    const offset = Vector3Utils.scale(Vector3Utils.inverse(forward), buddy_xy_offset);
    const final_buddy_offset = Vector3Utils.add(buddy_offset, offset);
    return Vector3Utils.add(player.GetAbsOrigin(), final_buddy_offset);
}
function getForwardVector(ang) {
    const pitchRad = ang.pitch * Math.PI / 180;
    const yawRad = ang.yaw * Math.PI / 180;
    // +X = forward, +Y = left, +Z = up
    const x = Math.cos(pitchRad) * Math.cos(yawRad);
    const y = Math.cos(pitchRad) * Math.sin(yawRad);
    const z = -Math.sin(pitchRad);
    // Normalize
    const len = Math.hypot(x, y, z) || 1;
    return { x: x / len, y: y / len, z: z / len };
}
